        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": "notes",
      "title": "This is the judge behind gemma_capfid and vid_rat",
      "text": "The repo serves this checkpoint on :9001 via vLLM (TP=2) for the rationality_v5 and cap_fid evaluations. The vLLM implementation is a second tab on the nodes where the two differ — it fuses QKV and uses paged attention, so the shapes on this page are the transformers reference, not what is allocated at serving time.",
      "code": [
